1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 5]

3
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,710
Father-in-law.

4
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:58,350
Your Highness, no need for courtesy.

5
00:01:12,070 --> 00:01:12,790
What was that sound?

6
00:01:12,790 --> 00:01:15,430
Just a careless servant.
Forgive us, Your Highness.

7
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:19,870
From now on,
I entrust my daughter to you.

8
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,920
Father-in-law, please rest assured.

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,840
I will visit your residence often.

10
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:27,710
Get in the sedan.
Don't miss the auspicious hour.

11
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:19,560
This is the first time in this life
you wear wedding dress.

12
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:23,150
It should have been with me.

13
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,240
Meeting again after rebirth,

14
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:29,630
I will take you somewhere nice.

15
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:47,150
I am curing the gu for you.

16
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:48,710
And you still strike me?

17
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,680
In your last life,

18
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,520
were you not tormented enough
by the Yin-Yang Gu?

19
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,310
With you,

20
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:55,840
it is never enough.

21
00:03:56,150 --> 00:03:57,910
You have already lost utterly,

22
00:03:58,030 --> 00:04:00,150
yet you still cling to life
this way in vain.

23
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,080
The Eighth Prince's wedding,

24
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:09,030
you can take it all in from here.

25
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,120
Do you remember?

26
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,560
This is the spot you chose

27
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,360
to watch the palace coup.

28
00:04:14,630 --> 00:04:15,710
I must admit,

29
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,680
you have excellent taste.

30
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:26,510
I wonder, when the Eighth Prince
finds out the bride isn't you,

31
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,720
will he make a huge scene in the palace?

32
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:35,310
Lu Qingcang,

33
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,310
you've lived a second life,

34
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:39,680
and your nonsense has doubled.

35
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,750
Are you insane?

36
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,560
Weren't you going to cure my gu?

37
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:58,120
Weren't you going to stay
entangled with me?

38
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,360
I don't like losing,

39
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:05,920
and I won't concede easily.

40
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,240
Since the Yin-Yang Gu is cast,

41
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,360
let us keep entangling

42
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,430
until one of us comes out on top.

43
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,240
Just the Shen Shuying I know,

44
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,920
strong-willed and never yielding.

45
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,120
Then let us continue

46
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,510
living entangled together.

47
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:52,310
Shuying.

48
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,310
Now

49
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,920
we are more than allies.

50
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,160
You are my consort as well.

51
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,920
The world believes
I am the Emperor's only son

52
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,720
and I get whatever I want

53
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,160
in this court.

54
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,950
But only I know

55
00:07:09,270 --> 00:07:11,120
that from childhood I never had
His Majesty's favor.

56
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:13,920
With so many constraints at court,

57
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,920
I played the wastrel

58
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:17,120
only to escape.

59
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,920
Until I met you.

60
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:25,430
How... How can it be you?

61
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,480
Where is Shen Shuying?

62
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,720
Her Ladyship was taken by Lu Qingcang.

63
00:07:31,870 --> 00:07:33,510
Your Highness, please save her.

64
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,830
After such exertion last night,

65
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:55,920
you can still get up this early?

66
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:58,040
Just like the young Shen Shuying.

67
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:01,480
I suppose that is a benefit of rebirth.

68
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,510
The Yin-Yang Gu has
been removed this time.

69
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:05,310
Why should I stay here any longer?

70
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,310
Do I really like you that much?

71
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:13,480
In such a hurry,

72
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,560
where are you going?

73
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:19,720
That is none of your concern.

74
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,310
I simply don't want to stay here.

75
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:24,480
You want to return to the palace
before court begins.

76
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,360
The day after a prince's wedding,

77
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,120
the consort must go with the prince

78
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,630
to greet His Majesty and Consort Shu.

79
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,910
Your plan

80
00:08:33,750 --> 00:08:35,200
is that as long as nothing blows up,

81
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,510
you will persuade the Eighth Prince

82
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:37,960
to restore your rank as consort.

83
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,440
Am I right?

84
00:08:43,550 --> 00:08:45,360
There is still time if you go now.

85
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,270
So

86
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,080
your decisiveness last night

87
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,910
was all to buy time.

88
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:52,670
I knew it.

89
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:54,960
You had something else in mind.

90
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:58,390
What are you up to?

91
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:01,080
To put an end to your foolish hopes.

92
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,440
You did not report me, did you?

93
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,480
We truly are in sync.

94
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,120
You always know my mind.

95
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,910
Yesterday I told the Ministry of War
where I was,

96
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,750
to be sure they could catch me,

97
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:16,510
and, while at it,

98
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,270
to stop you from returning
to the palace.

99
00:09:20,150 --> 00:09:21,120
Are you mad?

100
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:26,320
If I weren't mad, you'd have
killed me long ago.

101
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,750
Would I still be here
crashing the wedding?

102
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,270
To ruin my reputation,

103
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,790
you'd even risk your own life.

104
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:33,720
I mean to make it blow up,

105
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,720
so that Xiao Ningze

106
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:37,120
will harbor doubts.

107
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:43,600
Afraid?

108
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,200
But if it blows up,

109
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,720
you're more afraid than I am.

110
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,840
You are a deserter.

111
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,550
That is a capital crime of deceiving
His Majesty and defying orders.

112
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,120
For you,

113
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,720
I would die willingly.

114
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,870
General of the Left Camp, Lu Qingcang!

115
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,150
You ignored the law and defied
the imperial decree!

116
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:09,080
You evaded military service

117
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,320
and remained in the capital!

118
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:12,720
The Ministry of War arrests you
under military law!

119
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,510
I'm right here!

120
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,360
Lu Qingcang.

121
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,910
I advise you to surrender.

122
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,150
I'll surrender right now!

123
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,910
Let's go.

124
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,150
It is you they want.

125
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:31,440
Resistance is pointless.

126
00:10:32,030 --> 00:10:33,720
Any accomplices must surrender too.

127
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,480
But you helped me escape.

128
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:39,550
So you must be brought in too.

129
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,840
When did I ever help you?

130
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,270
I'll count to three. Come out now!

131
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,320
Shen Shuying,

132
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,630
I truly admire you.

133
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:51,270
You have been utterly routed,

134
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,630
and still you will not yield?

135
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:53,840
One.

136
00:10:56,750 --> 00:10:57,550
Two.

137
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:07,080
You... You would resist arrest?

138
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,510
It's a misunderstanding.

139
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:12,320
According to Dasheng's law,

140
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:13,790
anyone who aids a deserter

141
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:15,120
shall be arrested for questioning.

142
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,150
Who's in there?

143
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,360
Exactly, sir.

144
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,720
That's what I said too.

145
00:11:18,790 --> 00:11:20,510
You can hide for a while,
but not forever.

146
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,320
Don't keep the officer waiting.

147
00:11:22,550 --> 00:11:23,510
Come out quickly.

148
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,670
Whoever is inside, come out now!

149
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:27,120
Or we break the door down!

150
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:29,910
Sir.

151
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,960
It seems the one who helped me
dodge the draft

152
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,550
has a worse attitude than I do.

153
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:34,670
Must be punished severely.

154
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,480
Break it down!

155
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,510
Yes!

156
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:39,320
Come on.

157
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,510
Who dares enter?

158
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:53,910
Your Highness.

159
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,910
Good thing I made it in time.

160
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,150
So it really was you who dragged
her in here.

161
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:04,840
What if I told you she came
willingly?

162
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:05,790
Would you believe it?

163
00:12:05,790 --> 00:12:07,320
What exactly is your
relationship with her?

164
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:09,790
Even though you two are engaged,

165
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:12,080
she was with me on her wedding day.

166
00:12:12,270 --> 00:12:13,870
What do you think our relationship is?

167
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,510
As for today's matter,

168
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,550
if any of you dare leak a single word,

169
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:21,030
you know what I am capable of!

170
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,840
I know nothing.

171
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:24,840
No.

172
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,840
You know one thing.

173
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,910
Lu Qingcang refused border duty

174
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,910
and resisted arrest during the pursuit.

175
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:32,910
Today,

176
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,240
he is to be executed on the spot!

177
00:12:37,670 --> 00:12:38,910
I never resisted arrest.

178
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:41,030
In Dasheng, justice is clear as day.

179
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:43,240
Before the Ministry of War officials,

180
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:45,120
how could you frame me like that?

181
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,120
I am His Majesty's only son,

182
00:12:47,630 --> 00:12:49,000
the future emperor.

183
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,510
I obey only Your Highness.

184
00:12:52,870 --> 00:12:53,750
Did you hear that?

185
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:55,910
You may leave.

186
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,000
Yes.

187
00:12:57,390 --> 00:12:58,200
Let's go.

188
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,510
As long as you're dead,

189
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,390
everything that happened yesterday

190
00:13:05,390 --> 00:13:06,390
will stay unknown.

191
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:07,510
After all this,

192
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,150
you still want to win her back?

193
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,480
What kind of spell has Shen Shuying

194
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,320
cast on you?

195
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,550
She is my princess consort!

196
00:13:13,550 --> 00:13:15,150
She set you against Wei Chengjun.

197
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:17,440
The board is set, and she ran off.

198
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:18,720
There is nothing you can do now.

199
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,440
Shut up!

200
00:13:19,790 --> 00:13:20,870
Once I kill you,

201
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:22,480
everything will return to how it was.

202
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:24,030
I'll make a bet with you.

203
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:25,440
She will protect me.

204
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:27,670
Bet or not,

205
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,030
you're dead either way today.

206
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:31,440
Shen Shuying.

207
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,030
His Highness means to kill me.

208
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,320
I will not dodge.

209
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,080
Let him see

210
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,150
who truly lives in your heart.

211
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,480
The Yin-Yang Gu has been planted.

212
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:43,840
Lu Qingcang and I share one life.

213
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:44,790
If Xiao Ningze kills him,

214
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:45,910
I won't live much longer either.

215
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:47,720
You lunatic.

216
00:13:50,150 --> 00:13:51,360
Then go and die.

217
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,240
Stop!

218
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:35,930
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

219
00:14:36,490 --> 00:14:40,700
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

220
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:45,340
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

221
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,920
♪If fate turns once more♪

222
00:14:48,310 --> 00:14:50,770
♪Will our endings trade places♪

223
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,680
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

224
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:59,870
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

225
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:03,930
♪What tone should I take♪

226
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:07,040
♪To leave no trace♪

227
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:09,630
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

228
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:14,340
♪But the moment you come close♪

229
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:18,990
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

230
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,850
♪The lamplight flickers♪

231
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:24,290
♪Like your eyes♪

232
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:27,790
♪Already written into my fate♪

233
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:47,880
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

234
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:52,610
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

235
00:15:52,990 --> 00:15:57,410
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

236
00:15:57,750 --> 00:16:00,070
♪A test used as an excuse♪

237
00:16:00,070 --> 00:16:02,910
♪To stir the waters♪

238
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:07,090
♪But the moment you come close♪

239
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:11,960
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

240
00:16:12,110 --> 00:16:14,460
♪The lamplight flickers♪

241
00:16:14,630 --> 00:16:16,890
♪Like your eyes♪

242
00:16:16,890 --> 00:16:21,350
♪Already written into my fate♪
